---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-notice">This policy is pending final legal review. The content below is a structural placeholder.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>Khepia collects the following information during registration and platform use:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>CNIC number and images</li>
      <li>Name and contact information</li>
      <li>Overseas and Pakistan WhatsApp numbers</li>
      <li>Email address</li>
      <li>Parcel details (contents, weight, photographs, declared value)</li>
      <li>Recipient information</li>
      <li>Payment and transaction records</li>
      <li>Device and usage information</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
    <p>Information is used for account verification, matching senders with travellers, facilitating transactions, providing support, and improving the platform.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Information sharing</h2>
    <p>Contact details are shared between matched parties only after both sides commit. Khepia does not sell personal information to third parties.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>This section is pending legal review and will detail retention periods for different data categories.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. See <a href="/account-deletion">Account Deletion</a> for removal requests.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>Khepia will never ask you to share your password, OTP, or verification code over WhatsApp, email, or phone.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
